  "content": "<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">請注意<span style=\"color:#f60\">*</span> 此網站上的 128x 包對所有人免費。256x、512x 和 1024x 需要訂閱 Urban 的 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Urban_Textures_Pack?fan_landing=true\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Patreon 頁面</strong></a>&nbsp;</span></h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">以下是來自 512x 和 1024x 包的幾個小圖庫截圖。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252ftoJdPTH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/toJdPTH</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/124VkSyTjuahrKO6rAlYUJdVzidFS3eh4/view?usp=drive_link\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">「Urban」資源包由 Aryan Nikose 創建。該資源包適用於幾乎所有最新版本的基於 PBR（Physically Based Rendering）的 Minecraft。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">該資源包提供三種解析度。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">該資源包未 100% 完成；它會頻繁更新，每次更新後都更接近完整狀態。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">需要 Optifine 和 BSL 着色器以獲得類似效果，BSL v7.2 效果最佳。</span></h5><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000080;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">慶祝 Urban 四年。</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
